Chicken Tacos (Simple, High Protein)
✅ Ingredients (serves 2–3)
2 chicken breasts (or thighs)
1 tsp cumin
1 tsp paprika
1 tsp chilli powder
1 garlic clove (minced)
Juice of 1 lime
Salt & pepper
Small tortillas (corn or flour)

Toppings:

Avocado
Fresh coriander
Chopped onion
Salsa or chopped tomatoesUsing template, create recipe.


Method

Slice chicken into strips
Mix with spices, garlic, lime, salt & pepper
Fry in a hot pan (6–8 mins) until cooked
Warm tortillas
Assemble with toppings


💡 Why it works for you

High protein ✅
Flexible carbs (you can go low or moderate) ✅
Fast (<15 mins) ✅


🌯 2. Beef Burrito Bowl (Great for Lunch Recovery)
✅ Ingredients

200g lean minced beef
1 cup cooked rice (or cauliflower rice if lower carb)
1/2 tin black beans
1 pepper (sliced)
1 tsp cumin + paprika
1 tbsp tomato paste

Extras:

Greek yoghurt (instead of sour cream)
Guacamole
Lettuce


👨‍🍳 Method

Cook beef with spices and tomato paste
Fry peppers separately (or together if easier)
Heat beans
Add rice to bowl
Layer beef → beans → veg → toppings


💡 Why it works for you

Perfect post-training meal (carbs + protein) ✅
You control carb level depending on your day ✅
Good for recovery after cycling/gym ✅


🌶️ 3. Chilli Con Carne (Batch Cook / Easy Repeat)
✅ Ingredients (serves 4–5)

500g lean minced beef
1 tin chopped tomatoes
1 tin kidney beans
1 onion (chopped)
2 garlic cloves
1 tsp cumin
1 tsp paprika
1 tsp chilli powder


👨‍🍳 Method

Brown beef in a pan
Add onion + garlic → cook 3–4 mins
Add spices + tomatoes
Simmer 20–30 mins
Add beans for final 10 mins
